  "source_review": [
    "One owner-created absolute deadline covers the existing request and same-owner watch observation; no repeated request or extra read RPC.",
    "Prior failure returns first even after cleanup timeout; request error remains an error; existing native observer survives request timeout.",
    "New delayed confirmation uses coherent watch snapshots and final writer-locked state; ACK, EOF, Closed, cancellation and deadline do not manufacture exit.",
    "The one-second limit is a new cooperative owner policy; synchronous Local driver cannot be preempted and manager lock/cleanup are outside this budget.",
    "All six new tests were read with their actual fixtures; two explicit polls distinguish request ACK from native exit, controlled senders carry real numeric codes, original two-second outer watchdogs remain, and retained Arc identity is asserted."
